# r1113 chunk 2, rerun of boot c2a1's batch faults (verdicts: perf/runs/r1113/verdicts/c2a1.md). Fresh boot, same setup
# as c2_a1.qb: World group A (superflat creative; ground top y -61, stand at -60). Level name: fixc2a1.
# Setup before boot (server stopped):
#   prep_srv.sh OUT fixc2a1 A spawn-animals=true
#   cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/c2_probe.js  OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_c2_probe.js    (/zc2)
#   cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/zp_probe.js  OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_zp_probe.js    (/zp)
#   cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/zact_probe.js OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_zact_probe.js (/zact)
#   (zq is copied by prep_srv.sh). No config edits. perfBot jar comes with prep_srv.sh (bot c2b).
# Fixes: PJL-04 per-jar queries (prefix query hit the 40/80 cut); CFS-02b oven gets a cookable input (CfB burns fuel
#   only while shouldConsumeFuel(): processing slots hold something); STN-02k kettle rigged (FR slots: 0-1 ingredients,
#   2 drink display, 3 container, 4 output); STN-03 salt is vintagedelight:salt_dust (#forge:salt has only it, salt:salt
#   matched nothing) and the pickle recipe is creativedelight:pickling/pickle_from_fermenting; STN-06 pace 0 so the watch
#   starts before the 10-tick pull, sleep instead of a waitlog that matched the previous run's "watch done"; CBW-02
#   beef (carrot has no cutting recipe); BBQW-02 2 beef + cabbage off hand (raw_beef_skewer: 2x beef, side 2x cabbage);
#   BBQW-03 oak tray id is barbequesdelight:tray; ROLL-11 / BBQ2-05 control eat (bread, nutrition 5) and effect clear
#   before every eat (c2a1: every eat gave 4 more food than the item's nutrition, effects carried over, Raspberry Pie
#   diet Speed 800t); ROLL-12b live check of the roll medley cans; BBQ2-03 exact ids past the 80 cut; BBQ2-06 filet cut.
pace 1

## SQ-C2-00 | setup: area, gamerules, bot (not a test row)
> forceload add 296 290 360 380
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule doWeatherCycle false
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> time set noon
> weather clear
> pbot spawn c2b 300 -60 296 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> clear c2b
> zp inv c2b
waitlog \[zp\] done 20
reject \[zc2\] error|\[zp\] error

