## SQ-CFS-02b | real fuel: a hopper with coal into the side of an oven that has a raw potato to cook lights it
> setblock 316 -60 310 cookingforblockheads:oven[facing=north]{ItemHandler:{Items:[{Slot:0,id:"minecraft:potato",Count:3b}]}}
sleep 2
> zc2 state 316 -60 310
> setblock 317 -60 310 minecraft:hopper[facing=west]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:coal",Count:1b}]}
sleep 3
> zc2 state 316 -60 310
> zc2 inv 316 -60 310
> zc2 inv 317 -60 310
waitlog \[zc2\] inv 317 -60 310 20
expect \[zc2\] state 316 -60 310: .*lit=false
expect \[zc2\] state 316 -60 310: .*lit=true
look first state lit=false (potato, no fuel), second lit=true with BurnTime > 0 and the coal gone from the hopper; if the coal sits in slot 3 with BurnTime 0, read the potato's place (processing slots) before calling FAIL

