## SQ-ROLL-11 | golden roll +20, slice +10 hunger; not eaten at full hunger; control eat measures any hunger offset
> effect clear c2b
> zp hunger c2b 0
> pbot hold c2b minecraft:bread 1
> zp eat c2b
> effect clear c2b
> zp hunger c2b 0
> pbot hold c2b roll_delight:golden_roll_slice 1
> zp eat c2b
> effect clear c2b
> zp hunger c2b 4
> pbot hold c2b roll_delight:golden_roll 1
> zp eat c2b
> zp hunger c2b 20
> pbot hold c2b roll_delight:golden_roll 1
> zq useitem c2b
waitlog useitem c2b 20
expect \[zp\] eat c2b 1 minecraft:bread: .*food 5,
expect \[zp\] eat c2b 1 roll_delight:golden_roll_slice: .*food 10,
expect \[zp\] eat c2b 1 roll_delight:golden_roll: .*food 20,
look bread from 0 must read food 5: if it reads 9, the +4 is a pack-wide eat bonus (find its source before judging the rolls) and the slice's 14 is that, not a roll value. Effects: Nourishment 2400t on both is the comfort_nourishment golden rule (120 s), not a fault; useitem at full hunger FAIL/PASS (not eaten)
> effect clear c2b
> clear c2b

